{"4644750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veil of the Black Ark", "steam_appid": 4644750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/extras/1ef4abe083960c5800a4ce8f6734fdad.poster.avif?t=1787006177\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/extras/1ef4abe083960c5800a4ce8f6734fdad.webm?t=1787006177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/extras/1ef4abe083960c5800a4ce8f6734fdad.mp4?t=1787006177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Veil of the Black Ark</strong></i><strong> is a classic fixed-camera survival horror game set in a cursed medieval town.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the plague-ridden streets of Hollowmere, search for your missing sister, solve puzzles, and survive against the horrors awakened beneath the abbey. Inspired by classic survival horror, the game focuses on tense exploration, limited resources, atmospheric level design, and carefully placed encounters.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Classic Survival Horror</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fixed camera angles, careful resource management, backtracking, locked doors, keys, puzzles, and a constant sense of danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Dark Medieval Setting</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a quarantined town filled with abandoned streets, crypts, sewers, old houses, religious sites, and secrets buried beneath the abbey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Puzzle-Based Exploration</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths, discover hidden items, read notes, and piece together what happened in Hollowmere before the town fell into darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Limited Resources</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon, healing item, and piece of ammunition matters. Avoid unnecessary fights or stand your ground when there is no other way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Story of Faith, Death, and Corruption</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the outbreak, the sealed abbey, and the ancient relic known as the Black Ark.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/extras/1ef4abe083960c5800a4ce8f6734fdad.poster.avif?t=1787006177\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/extras/1ef4abe083960c5800a4ce8f6734fdad.webm?t=1787006177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/extras/1ef4abe083960c5800a4ce8f6734fdad.mp4?t=1787006177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Veil of the Black Ark</strong></i><strong> is a classic fixed-camera survival horror game set in a cursed medieval town.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the plague-ridden streets of Hollowmere, search for your missing sister, solve puzzles, and survive against the horrors awakened beneath the abbey. Inspired by classic survival horror, the game focuses on tense exploration, limited resources, atmospheric level design, and carefully placed encounters.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Classic Survival Horror</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fixed camera angles, careful resource management, backtracking, locked doors, keys, puzzles, and a constant sense of danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Dark Medieval Setting</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a quarantined town filled with abandoned streets, crypts, sewers, old houses, religious sites, and secrets buried beneath the abbey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Puzzle-Based Exploration</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths, discover hidden items, read notes, and piece together what happened in Hollowmere before the town fell into darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Limited Resources</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon, healing item, and piece of ammunition matters. Avoid unnecessary fights or stand your ground when there is no other way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Story of Faith, Death, and Corruption</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the outbreak, the sealed abbey, and the ancient relic known as the Black Ark.</p>", "short_description": "A classic fixed-camera survival horror game set in a cursed medieval town. Search for your missing sister, solve puzzles, survive the roaming dead and unveil the secrets of the Black Ark.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/5b20b4421ad1bbd8a166ed0535ec4678a904a753/header.jpg?t=1787006177", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/ed608e3ea40dd409862715d4ff65f5b34f32371b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787006177", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644750/ed608e3ea40dd409862715d4ff65f5b34f32371b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787006177", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</str